From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] hi3881: adapt the OAL/WAL layers to Linux 7.3

Use the real kernel version, update the timer/time/type
interfaces, cfg80211 ops, SDIO detect, securec, WEXT,
station/AP wrappers and the scheduler helper.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
